[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Public Low Level Requirements
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-LOW-LEVEL-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PLLR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: VERIFICATION_METHOD
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Test, Inspection)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Refines
    REVERSE_ROLE: Refined By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-APP-ROOT
TITLE: Public App Root

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-APP-ROOT-ELEMENT
TITLE: App Root

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-4
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL contain a Header host, an Announcements Bar when the App Root shows that bar, a Page Outlet, a Footer host, and a Prompt Overlay host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root composes those subelements so Header, Footer, announcements, the active public page, and the Prompt Overlay share one shell. Header and Footer contents are separate requirements. When the App Root shows the Announcements Bar is a separate requirement. When the Prompt Overlay host shows the overlay is a separate requirement.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-38
GSSC5-27
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-20
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL fill the entire viewport.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root is the outermost shell of the public page. Filling the viewport gives Header, page content, and Footer a full-page layout that resizes with the viewport.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-21
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL use the white theme token for its background and the sans-serif theme font for its text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The outermost site layer uses a white background and a sans-serif default. Theme tokens supply those values.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-HOST
TITLE: Header Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-5
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL hold the Public Frontend Header.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root supplies a host so Header implementation mounts in the public shell. Header contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-22
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL stick to the top of the viewport while the visitor scrolls.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages keep the Header at the top. Sticking the host keeps that top placement as the visitor scrolls.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-23
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host is an empty mount for Header contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until Header paints its own presentation. Independent Header host colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-FOOTER-HOST
TITLE: Footer Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-6
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL hold the Public Frontend Footer.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root supplies a host so Footer implementation mounts in the public shell. Footer contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-24
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL sit at the bottom of the App Root.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages place the Footer at the bottom. The host anchors that placement in the App Root.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-25
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Footer host is an empty mount for Footer contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until Footer paints its own presentation. Independent Footer host colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

