[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-PROMPT-OVERLAY-HOST
TITLE: Prompt Overlay Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-104
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Prompt Overlay host SHALL hold the Public Prompt Overlay when that overlay is open.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR defines a prompt overlay. The App Root supplies a host so the Prompt Overlay mounts in the public shell when open. Overlay Contents are separate requirements. Derived because PIRs do not define this host.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27). REVIEW_STATUS stays Changed until owner approval.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-105
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Prompt Overlay host SHALL overlay the Public Prompt Overlay on the App Root above the Header, Page Outlet, and Footer while leaving those App Root elements in place.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Overlaying the prompt on the App Root keeps the prompt above page content without shifting Header, Page Outlet, or Footer layout.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-106
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Prompt Overlay host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Prompt Overlay host is a mount for the Prompt Overlay. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until the overlay paints its own presentation. Independent host colors are not set yet.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-PAGE-OUTLET
TITLE: Page Outlet

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-7
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL render the active public page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Public pages mount through the Page Outlet so each page shares the App Root shell. Page contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-26
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL sit between the Header host and the Footer host and SHALL grow to fill the remaining App Root space.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placing the outlet between the hosts and letting it grow keeps Header and Footer at the edges while page content uses the middle of the shell as the viewport resizes.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-27
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Page Outlet is a mount for page contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so pages share the shell defaults until a page sets its own presentation. Independent Page Outlet colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-ANNOUNCEMENTS-BAR
TITLE: Announcements Bar

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-15
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL display the title and text of each urgent public announcement it receives, and SHALL open the home page announcements display focused on an announcement when the visitor selects that announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The bar presents urgent announcement contents and routes the visitor to that announcement on the home page. Title and text refine the urgent announcement contents. Selection refines urgent announcement selection.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-30
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-31
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-34
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-16
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The App Root SHALL show the Announcements Bar between the Header host and the Page Outlet on every public page other than the home page when there is an urgent public announcement to display, and SHALL omit the Announcements Bar on the home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Container belongs on non-home public pages when an urgent announcement exists. The home page uses the Announcements Display instead. Placement under the Header host keeps the bar in the shared shell.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-27
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-47
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-17
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL use the cream theme token for its background, the gray theme token for its bottom border, the dark-green theme token for announcement titles, and the dark-brown theme token for announcement text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Theme tokens keep announcement presentation aligned with the organization palette. A fuller color role map for the bar is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-47
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-MODULES
TITLE: Modules

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER
TITLE: Public Header

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-ELEMENT
TITLE: Header

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-46
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL present the Header Logo, the Header Organization Name when the layout permits, the Header account-access controls, the Header Contact control, and the Header Site Search control.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header composes those displayed elements in the Header host. Each element's behavior is a separate requirement.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). REVIEW_STATUS stays Changed until owner approval.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-47
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL fill the Header host and arrange identity and Header actions in a horizontal bar that wraps as the viewport narrows.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host already sticks to the top of the viewport. Filling that host and wrapping the bar keeps Header contents available as the page resizes.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-48
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL use the light-green theme token for its background, the gray theme token for a thicker bottom border, and the dark-green theme token for its text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Theme tokens keep Header presentation aligned with the organization palette. A fuller color role map for the Header is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Thicker bottom border approved for GSSC5-22. Color tokens remain provisional until a full color role map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-LOGO
TITLE: Logo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-49
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL display the GSSC Logo, and selection of the Header Logo SHALL open the public home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header always includes the GSSC Logo so the visitor can identify the society. Selecting the logo returns the visitor to the public home page.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Placeholder SVG mark is acceptable until brand artwork lands in GSSC5-46 (logo branding across favicon, Header, and Footer).
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-50
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL appear at the start of the Header in every layout.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Leading placement keeps the logo visible whether or not the organization name also fits.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-51
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL use the dark-green theme token for its mark color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A single theme token keeps the mark readable on the Header background until a brand color role is set.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-ORG-NAME
TITLE: Organization Name

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-52
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL display the society's organization name or organization acronym from the Society Contact service when the layout permits.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header shows one organization-name form at a time from the Society Contact service. Which form is visible by layout width is a separate Lexical requirement.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Owner-approved layout bands (GSSC5-22): full name at medium and above; acronym from small up to under medium; omit below small (logo remains). Brand artwork deferred to GSSC5-46.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-53
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL appear beside the Header Logo when the layout permits a name, and SHALL be omitted from the Header when the layout does not permit a name.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placement beside the logo keeps identity together. Omitting the name on a narrow layout leaves the logo as the identity mark.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-54
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL use the sans-serif theme font, a medium font weight, and the dark-green theme token for its text color, SHALL show the organization name at medium and above, SHALL show the organization acronym from small up to under medium, and SHALL omit the name below small.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Those tokens keep the name aligned with Header text. The width bands keep a readable identity mark as the viewport narrows or widens.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-LOGIN
TITLE: Login

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-55
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When no member is logged in, the Header Login control SHALL navigate the visitor to the members-only application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Login on the public Header is navigation to the Member Frontend. Member Frontend UI is out of this requirement's scope.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). Proposed default members origin for local development: http://localhost:4201.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-56
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Login control SHALL appear first among the Header right-side action controls when no member is logged in, SHALL be omitted when a member is logged in, and SHALL be separated from the following right-side text control by a vertical divider.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Owner-approved right-side order is Login, then Contact, then Site Search. Vertical dividers separate right-side text items. The Greeting replaces Login when a member is logged in.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-57
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Login control SHALL use the sans-serif theme font and the dark-green theme token for its text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Account-access controls share Header text tokens until a fuller control style map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-MEMBER-ACCESS
TITLE: Member Access

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-58
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When a member is logged in, the Header Member Access control SHALL navigate the visitor to the members-only application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member reaches the Member Frontend through Member Access instead of Login.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-59
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Member Access control SHALL appear in the Header Greeting dropdown when a member is logged in, and SHALL be omitted when no member is logged in.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Member Access is reached from the Greeting dropdown rather than replacing Login as a top-level control.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-60
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Member Access control SHALL use the sans-serif theme font and the dark-green theme token for its text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Account-access controls share Header text tokens until a fuller control style map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

