STATEMENT: >>>
The Resources Next control SHALL present a tailless next-direction arrow icon with no border, rounded corners, the dark-green theme token for its icon color, a transparent background, and the gray theme token for its background on hover.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A borderless rounded icon control matches other public icon buttons. Gray hover marks Next as activatable without changing the icon color. A fuller control color map is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
