When the Error Container presents Application Error Contents, the error name, error description, error reference number, and debugging information SHALL use the dark-red theme token for their text color, with the error name at a semibold weight and the remaining fields at a normal weight.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Semibold dark-red distinguishes the error name on the light-red Error Container. Normal-weight dark-red keeps supporting Application Error fields aligned with the error chrome. A fuller type scale is not set yet beyond these weight and token choices.
