STATEMENT: >>>
The Error Container Dismiss control SHALL appear at the top-right of the Error Container chrome banner outside the scrollable Contents region, with Escape dismissing the Error Container when the Error Container is focused, and with dismiss restoring the focus that was active before the Error Container was presented.
<<<
