[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-CONTACT-OVERLAY
TITLE: Public Contact Overlay

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-155
TITLE: Open
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Contact Overlay SHALL enqueue its contact form on the Public Frontend Prompt Overlay when a visitor opens it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR defines a contact overlay. Header Contact and Footer Contact open this overlay so a visitor can draft a message to the organization. Queueing the form on the Prompt Overlay reuses that shell. Phone number, email address, and postal address stay on the Footer. Derived because PIRs do not define this overlay.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-31). Promotes the prior software-only contact form PoC. No send or mail API is in scope.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-31
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-CONTACT-FORM
TITLE: Contact Form

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-156
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Contact Overlay form SHALL collect the visitor's name, email address, contact reason, and message for a draft message to the organization, require each of those inputs before accepting submit, and complete the draft when the visitor submits a valid form.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The form is the draft Contents for a message to the organization. Required inputs keep an incomplete draft from completing. Completing the draft ends the current Contact Overlay form without a send or mail API.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-31). Field module chrome is owned by Prompt Overlay requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-31
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-157
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Contact Overlay form SHALL appear as the current Prompt Overlay form when the Public Contact Overlay is open.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Presenting the contact form through the Prompt Overlay keeps Contact Overlay Contents in the shared prompt shell without a separate overlay container.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-31). Overlay chrome sizing and dismiss remain Prompt Overlay requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-31
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-158
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Contact Overlay form SHALL use the title Contact; the field labels Name, Email, Contact reason, and Message; the contact reason choices General inquiry, Membership, Research help, and Other; the submit control label Submit; and the Prompt Overlay text, options-list, and button field modules for those fields.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Those labels and choices define the Contact Overlay draft wording. Reusing Prompt Overlay field modules keeps Contact Overlay presentation aligned with other prompt forms. Field module Lexical detail remains under Prompt Overlay requirements.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-31).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-31
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

